│                          │ directly serve demand and connect traffic-heavy endpoints. Quadratic terms discourage     │
│                          │ choosing links that compete for the same source or destination capacity, while a          │
│                          │ demand-sensitive reciprocal-link adjustment can favor useful two-way connections. The     │
│                          │ sparse pair generation stays within the quadratic-term limit.                             │
