│ patch_name               │ capacity_aware_paths                                                                      │
│ patch_description        │ Keep the direct-demand reward, but add a restrained quadratic reward for completing       │
│                          │ two-hop routes. Unlike a fixed reward for every two-hop path, divide each demand’s        │
│                          │ contribution among its possible intermediaries and discount intermediaries with high      │
│                          │ total in/out demand. This limits overcounting and makes transit capacity a consideration, │
│                          │ while preserving the baseline as the dominant signal. The number of quadratic terms is at │
│                          │ most n(n−1)(n−2), within the stated limit.                                                │
