│                          │ relay signal rather than rewarding every possible relay equally. Relay bonuses are        │
│                          │ moderated relative to direct-link rewards and favor intermediates with lower overall      │
│                          │ demand pressure, which may be better positioned to carry transit traffic. The terms       │
│                          │ remain sparse: they use only valid directed two-hop paths, within the allowed cubic       │
│                          │ bound. A stronger external degree penalty helps keep the low-energy region focused on     │
│                          │ valid topologies.                                                                         │
